{"id":10000052,"name":"雷电将军","enName":"Raiden Shogun","title":"一心净土","element":"雷","region":"稻妻","rarity":5,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"6月26日","constellation":"天下人座","description":"其身为御建鸣神主尊大御所大人，许稻妻人民以亘古不变之「永恒」。","affiliation":"稻妻城","cv":{"chinese":"菊花花","japanese":"泽城美雪","english":"安妮·雅科","korean":"朴志㣧"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000052-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000052-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Raiden_Shogun.zip","voicePackageEn":"Raiden_Shogun","quoteCount":77,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"无须行礼，此身虽然尊贵殊胜，不过此般前来，是想要做些微服游历民间的事。我看上了你的身手，现在你就是我的御侧保镖了。不用担心，遇到危险，我会出手的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/7zlvt290he9vhwz1m4wpze810kxly7y.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·徒然","desc":"徒然无事，对砚枯坐。哼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/ig5r7v24q6ebri9hses6wkyrgj7mgh8.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·浮世","desc":"浮世景色百千年依旧，人之在世却如白露与泡影。虚无。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/mddr1o8xxf63rkpxm7uxq6ycttzq8vj.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·花鸟余情","desc":"无人相陪，此般花鸟余情，也不过衬托我身不移不变的背景罢了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/13/hsc657osr1622y5oe5751lznlr9sa0d.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"只是雨滴有什么麻烦的。这还没有打雷呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/pj1gu4e87zbwn81hlquvobhlxowbucz.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"哎呀，你不会怕了吧。明明此世最为殊胜最为恐怖的雷霆化身就站在你身边。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/gbk463w5dkebim9fe1a1szqrgryl93r.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"冬将军也来了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/pb606k20m6llawlknf5i6tkggjihqz9.mp3"},{"title":"晴天的时候…","desc":"天晴也并不能掩盖雷霆的威光。不下雨也可以降下神雷，看到那棵树了吗？你说你懂了，叫我停手。好吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/bdmavshiyzz80013kezo5897xom4y2m.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"道完早安就打呵欠，太懈怠了。我这次就赦免你的无礼了。早安。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/i7k37ph8qu6liejt675tk96sex46mud.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"啊，想吃甜点心。嗯，为什么不行？什么叫「哪有这个时间吃甜品的」。之前是因为他们看我是将军所以惯着我的？这样啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/7dlleca6c0zwijudeb8gjn0ixdmppf4.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"你想知道夜晚流星的真相吗？哈哈，真相就是缥缈须臾的一瞬天光罢了。嗯，你说其实是你？你也是天狗吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/41myywqzj1xuddad0pbhorhkwjsehs0.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"我命十方世界雷鸣平息，愿你今晚得享安睡。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/hhnw9qvgp4oms2szb7jj3sjybgrliut.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷电将军自己·须臾","desc":"雷鸣闪电，一瞬即逝。正因如此，才会想要撷取「永恒」。不，才必须掌握「永恒」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/keg3hjovdg5hxdhmltuycamlcoy8qle.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷电将军自己·永恒","desc":"「磨损」是一件很可怕的事情。此身诞生的意义，就是承受磨损。这样，或许「内在」就可以触及永恒了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/lj43e6n9kv08w5ojfuuanwe4dkdolsw.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·奥诘众","desc":"现在你是我的侧用人，换言之，依我判断，你是对幕府有用，对我忠诚的人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/cq94sf00uhfdmi4yj28l89lw6jh97xp.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·用心棒","desc":"虽然是微服出访的保镖，但是我遇到危险不用替我挡刀了。将军她构造还挺结实的，坏了还能替换呢。所以遇到危险把将军她推到前面就好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/agyo3wz5fgdcjoh8gk52h5tn0w30iyi.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·直传","desc":"稻妻的薙刀术和剑术以及锻刀技法，基本都是由我直接传下的，随后因人资质不同而分枝开花、各自结果。\n如何，再接我一刀？还能无事的话，许可你在稻妻开宗立派哦。啊，武艺的精进真是叫人欲罢不能。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/r63bfj8d8b08v3oq8wfizr1j15tl7yb.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"外面的世界居然已经这么久没有出现过雷元素的神之眼了吗？虽然我因为一些制约无法说明…赐予神之眼这件事，和我的意志无关。重要的，还是人的「渴望」，以及…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/dnhq9t886wro1h23bbsq3yz8b8qbcf2.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"有什么想要分享的？没有。倒是你，为什么没有神之眼却能使用元素之力。和我说说。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/d5egkz5va925op3911zmb7yaxlcmx5y.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"虽然身消梦陨，但是她化作了神樱。这，也是「永恒」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/nchartcvxnxtfrs0t26az2e19u6x0yo.mp3"},{"title":"关于八重神子…","desc":"那家伙啊，最初她就是个会被油豆腐引诱的家伙。现在居然这么工于谋略了，让人欣慰。不过被她算计了，还是有些不愉快。虽说是为了我好，下次见到她恐怕会被她嘲笑的…那就先发制人，斩她一刀好了。反正她也能躲掉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_yaeMiko_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1f/g0aavn8wmlp3dutzmlwx564etl6qqkw.mp3"},{"title":"关于神里绫人…","desc":"神里一门，无愧于稻妻名门笔头之格。绫人虽然此前在三奉行事务中，耍了不少手段，但是本身忠心可鉴。既往不咎了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_teammate_ayato_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f4/f50w3y3jh01ldgqg8z25ubl3ax0m4jc.mp3"},{"title":"关于神里绫华…","desc":"神里一门，无愧于稻妻名门笔头之格。欸，你说我和将军的评价一模一样。那，绫华她，她剑术也很好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_ayaka_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/rom6dz4d8a04wxf59vp1a8yjj8i75wl.mp3"},{"title":"关于九条裟罗…","desc":"忠义之士，武艺精湛，可担「豪杰」二字。有此麟儿，九条家应该还能兴盛下去吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_teammate_kujoSara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/md5baj6dip50tgrdvw2hjjhlu8fuzf3.mp3"},{"title":"关于宵宫…","desc":"是谁来着？啊，做烟火的。制造须臾幻象的人，沉醉于夏日幻觉的人，虽说如此，亦为我之臣民。\n嗯，在天领奉行属地里炸烟花？谁啊，她吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_teammate_yoimiya_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/gwkcm9jofchhqbvuud4tm7tf1j2e746.mp3"},{"title":"关于托马…","desc":"虽然差点夺走他神之眼这件事，我也不能说是完全没有责任。但要说道歉的话，还是应该让将军她去比较好吧…好吧，我也会好好反省的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_thoma_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/2dko2okjpkgzn9nril0fud71c8lz08m.mp3"},{"title":"关于珊瑚宫心海…","desc":"奥罗巴斯确为此身所斩。但是我也许可了珊瑚宫之民，以海祇大御神之名继续祭祀，让它得享牲醴。现在珊瑚宫捣毁鸣神分社，反叛幕府。她作为海祇大御神的现人神巫女，必须要承担责任。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_teammate_kokomi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/3jxbe5utok7a8ewxdnu6nvqpbsuja89.mp3"},{"title":"关于国崩…","desc":"那小子是制造将军的副产物。对他不加以管束，应该是因为我内心还是觉得对他有所亏欠吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_kunikuzushi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/69/ju9pnmpvf4vp9tjs8115ogf5b776zr5.mp3"},{"title":"关于荒泷一斗…","desc":"谁？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_teammate_itto_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a8/9udz2tokanovczf7uwqn0cukk4bo44y.mp3"},{"title":"关于摩拉克斯…","desc":"曾经与他共饮之时，我还只是一介影武者，敬陪众神末席。他做出了这样的选择是吗？不过，我想他在下一个时代，仍然会继续和更多的人相遇吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_zhongli_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/mxxxi7hvn57fgr9w3i7yc7mox0zwuz6.mp3"},{"title":"关于温迪…","desc":"风神的化身现在还叫这个名字吗？说实话，第一次见他就感觉他浑身透着和我一定相处不来的气质。然后就是，他的确很能喝酒。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_venti_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/42/ed3wa22ulzepdanj6fjv8i8cyszejyk.mp3"},{"title":"关于布耶尔…","desc":"我很欣赏她的谦逊，谦逊也的确是智者的美德。她的权能理应可以做到许多超乎想象的事，但布耶尔只是将它用在「纠正与守护」之上…真是个温柔的神明。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_nahida_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/0541m6irsfui52ejxaon9t892h5nyw3.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"「雷电将军」曾与我在意识世界中进行数百年的决斗，以确定我的意志不曾动摇。而你所说的这位芙宁娜，虽是人类之躯，但五百年间的表演也无异于每时每刻都在进行精神上的「实战」。我认可她，此等意志，可谓已臻神境。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/8rorvrjsuhe1unfcu57tns0kxs5b5qp.mp3"},{"title":"关于梦见月瑞希…","desc":"梦见月瑞希是神子的旧识，不过，我有些看不明白她们两位的关系…既是彼此无可替代的友人，又不愿将感情置于台面。总是为某些计划相持不下，想要决出高低…鉴于这些计划的核心都是帮助民众享受生活，我便不多说什么了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_teammate_mizuki_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/gzoquzw1xlknt6zqfy1wm0htottss4f.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解雷电将军·其一","desc":"有什么事情，说来便是。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/ccyb8rs1fd2fpai6qn72ew6jz4h4rin.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解雷电将军·其二","desc":"民间都相信，雷雨天口念「桑原桑原」，便可以无恙。如是因我一念而起的雷暴，必不会加害于你。但是自然天气形成的雷雨就难说了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/p91nfgs9lde533qzjdj8ld9agu1jei9.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解影·其三","desc":"《珍说》一书所言大致都是真的。那时她正忙于周旋岛内之事，于是我作为影武者，假托她名出现在了平定海祇的军阵中。但是后面的剧情，就只是人们的一厢情愿罢了。我原本只是醉心剑技的武人，没有那种感化万民的德行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/js50fbhftfjbia1smp40rj5yiovnvvy.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解影·其四","desc":"追求「永恒」可能也只是一种逃避罢了。最后我采取的方法也和缩壳乌龟一样。不过乌龟本来就是长寿的象征，说不定追求永恒就是会变成这样的形态。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/47/kypd7v25h34d8qs8nmtbuztcnv6lqpe.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解影·其五","desc":"恐惧是因为我在五百年前目睹了她的消亡和「那个事物」。但，如果…如果是你的话，一定可以拯救所有人的。如果是你的话，一定会拯救世界的。就像是我记得稻妻的一切一样，只要你记得我，我就能永远地活着。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/3q7jym134reaqqnk9a2n1yx3z7rkt2u.mp3"},{"title":"雷电将军的爱好…","desc":"愚问。只有必须要做的事情，和一定不能做的事情。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a4/5i0xcof0yx80h3hgre377tc8uu2jp45.mp3"},{"title":"影的烦恼…","desc":"你不要让我做饭啦。我什么都能办到，但是真的不会做饭。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/sxh9jnq5qxw22hl0ufetqx2x6rie738.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"你别听将军她的。甜点心！蛀牙什么的，换一套就好了。这怎么会影响对永恒的追求呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/q72p50pyutf6d1tdkkzo06wrgej0qiv.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"愚问。只有维持身体营养必须吃的，和会损害身体的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7a/s2fq6rrizsdwlmiu84xalyox77cagfa.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"熟悉的味道。不坏。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/fxi52deze4e8guge8x0x0m20kt82nlg.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"放在这里吧，我会尝的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/r3yptquoowyzr8fjbwt7r8bkilmqotu.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"会损害身体机能，拿走。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/1df3hfv9otpoeiczxwqeljrkjyq0vf6.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其四","desc":"好吃。心情也放松了不少，谢谢你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/9l2iii1xlf7b06e2mzgr8xuhe5e8mrj.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其五","desc":"看起来不错，是怎么做出来的？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/6gh978an21oi21o9gcynbwca59nvswq.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其六","desc":"恕我谢绝。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/agubu0s1yvwogjlhixkzi7jy18c045c.mp3"},{"title":"生辰…","desc":"今日是你的生辰之日吗？随我回城，我来对全体旗本众宣读祝词吧。嗯？「太丢人别这样。」…好吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/izk21ysh4pl1kvt4ftkc1dtcv9tcspv.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐！那今日就一起庆祝吧，使之成为可以铭记一年的美好瞬间。然后等到来年今日，便继续庆祝。如是便可得「永恒」的快乐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_pref_birthday_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/n2q1l8wuj89gi6478tr6o8p5s22zs85.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"我之流派里，「初传」之位，可以学习太刀的九向剑路之势，以及薙刀术的基本。与其他流派并无大差异。应该说，其他流派与我之流派并无差异。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/nfzx6j4jvwk6wc03i89jr6rio9g14nt.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"我之流派里，「中传」之位，太刀术需要研习各种「构」位与变化，薙刀术则需熟练诸「切」与「返」之理。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/rjw62s5kt56ymvl2s58fow36cqdrtfz.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"我之流派里，「皆传」之位，需要研习诸般奥义。无奈大部分都需要配合元素之力，对凡人来说可能有些太难了。世间其余流派大多都无法触及此境。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/cmkd4yij6y1f49m2jaovgr13m79zn98.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"奥义中的奥义，也就是「无想」又无双的一刀。有你作为陪练之宾，我好像能挥出更强更快的一剑。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenEi_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/ql3rmpdpnraqtfb40ioblp447szpwnp.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"威光无赦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/70/0drvqxp6ww5vq9sp1yij4bzpiiso2n2.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"无处遁逃！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a9/tk2nvr9dchhc59kk262pmmxx21lqo1n.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"泡影看破！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/5c7tw6ny55n25ptsabkj1mgkc54p1le.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"无念，断绝！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/dyenjzkvdkm95nwoj0l40mb24aa8ybx.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"此刻，寂灭之时！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/ll92702ilu34gg9uexewuui9sqq90f9.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"稻光，亦是永恒！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/ox1bgnpuz889e187azh1zeupfn5pyfh.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"收下吧，于我无用。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/jjlx3zqnhxq0br67kvpmwmeyfxfcrnp.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"…不过须臾之梦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/lqzi2vw7j1z2t1gmy8otebfj96wskgn.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"嗯？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/4045t7kxekro4wz90hwinvgn520e7er.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"…枷锁当断。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ab/9ywn4olgkp0epswtr1w9w390ie51ry9.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"…诸恶当斩。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ac/hvof5cj90w07tewxga4y8s0kdfautjd.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"…肃清阻碍。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/55zzfuzgt1t194wr2woo2egianqvpfu.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"至我后方待命。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/nu1i4o8pulrv0xm8fxb24ccn56j96ub.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"退下。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/9h7yka8ly7kd5gaj6407tpyul583xok.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"浮世一梦…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/dgo2tscn52f8cxdgixl489sho5bu2of.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"无念，无执…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/e2ad8s9mvdn95q6om8mkixrg2rmrvlv.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"雷鸣，将歇…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/k9euax3ztlhl3yyum2eyhub2x3htfqo.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"无礼…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/f1kbbs96nfuaaw6v78yj4s86aakbn9v.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"荒谬…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_raidenShogun/vo_raidenShogun_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/dqouta7wcdyqytb7cn6nwqt3dxfb5vy.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"有什么事？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_raidenShogun_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/i6lz1x9wvjav7myfqoakn3ok8kwq6ga.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"随我左右即可。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_raidenShogun_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/42/9swht5qmmfzn7qkbnpw3doyy6vp5eyf.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"出征之时已至。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_raidenShogun_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/29ayrghvu94v8dm297bhhz36xau0j28.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000052-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000052-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1016,"fullArtHeight":1005}